{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42917","headline":"酒胡子 · 卢注","name":"酒胡子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"同心相遇思同欢，擎出酒胡当玉盘。\n盘中臲卼不自定，四座清宾注意看。\n可亦不在心，否亦不在面，徇客随时自圆转。\n酒胡五藏属他人，十分亦是无情劝。\n尔不耕，亦不饥。\n尔不蚕，亦有衣。\n有眼不能分黼黻，有口不能明是非。\n鼻何尖，眼何碧，仪形本非天地力。\n雕镌匠意苦多端，翠帽朱衫巧妆饰。\n长安斗酒十千酤，刘伶平生爲酒徒。\n刘伶虚向酒中死，不得酒池中拍浮。\n酒胡一滴不入眼，空令酒胡名酒胡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢注","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}